{
  "tema": 6985,
  "slug": "verbos-de-cambio",
  "titulo": "Convertirse en / ponerse / hacerse / quedarse = to become",
  "subtitulo": "Se convirtió en actriz, se hizo vegetariana, se puso roja, se quedó sordo.",
  "foto": "t04.jpg",
  "regla": "To become: convertirse en (a radical change), hacerse (profession, ideology, religion, also by effort), ponerse + adjective (temporary changes in mood, health, look), quedarse + adjective (a lasting result, often a loss).",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "English uses _become, get, turn, go_ for all kinds of changes. Spanish picks the verb by the **type of change**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Verb",
            "Type of change",
            "Example"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "convertirse en + noun",
              "radical transformation",
              "se convirtió en una estrella"
            ],
            [
              "hacerse + noun / adjective",
              "profession, beliefs, religion; often by effort",
              "se hizo doctora, se hizo vegetariano"
            ],
            [
              "ponerse + adjective",
              "temporary: mood, health, color, looks",
              "se puso nervioso, se puso rojo"
            ],
            [
              "quedarse + adjective",
              "a lasting result, often a loss",
              "se quedó ciego, se quedó sin trabajo"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "All four are pronominal (**se**). Only **convertirse** needs **en**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Convertir** without **se** = _to turn someone into_: **sus hazañas lo convirtieron en un héroe**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **ponerse** is the mood ring, **quedarse** is the scar, **hacerse** is the career, **convertirse** is the butterfly."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "convertirse",
      "titulo": "Convertirse en",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
